---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeading from '../components/PageHeading.astro';
import {content} from '../data/content';
---
<Layout title="Makeup academy in Janakpuri, West Delhi" description="Explore makeup education at SandhyaVermaMakeovers Academy in Janakpuri. Enquire about courses, curriculum and upcoming batches.">
<PageHeading eyebrow="SANDHYA VERMA / THE ACADEMY" title="Your passion." accent="Your next possibility." text="Take your curiosity beyond the mirror. Explore makeup education with our academy in Janakpuri, West Delhi." />
<div class="section-wrap batch-banner"><span class="star">✦</span><div><span class="eyebrow">THE NEXT CHAPTER</span><h3>Upcoming batches</h3><p>Batch dates, fees and schedules are being confirmed. Leave an enquiry to learn more.</p></div><a class="button button-outline" href="/contact/?interest=Academy%20courses">Enquire about courses ↗</a></div>
<section class="section-wrap section-space"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">FIND YOUR DIRECTION</span><h2>Where would you<br /><em>like to begin?</em></h2></div><p>These are proposed learning interests for this preview. Confirmed course details will be published by the academy.</p></div><div class="course-grid">{content.courses.map((course,i)=><article class="course-card"><span class="card-number">0{i+1}</span><h3>{course.title}</h3><p>{course.description}</p><dl><dt>FORMAT</dt><dd>{course.duration}</dd><dt>NEXT BATCH</dt><dd>{course.batch}</dd></dl><a href="/contact/?interest=Academy%20courses" class="text-link">Ask about this course ↗</a></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="section-wrap faq-section"><span class="eyebrow">GOOD QUESTIONS</span><h2>A little clarity,<br /><em>before you begin.</em></h2><div class="faqs"><details><summary>Can I enquire as a complete beginner?</summary><p>Yes. Tell the team about your experience and interests so they can discuss a suitable learning path.</p></details><details><summary>Where is the academy?</summary><p>Our academy is at C5B/7A, Janakpuri, New Delhi, Delhi 110058. Visiting hours are 10:00 AM–5:00 PM; please arrange your visit with the team first.</p></details><details><summary>What are the course fees and duration?</summary><p>Fees, curriculum, kit inclusions and duration are awaiting confirmation. Request course information before deciding.</p></details><details><summary>Are certificates or placements included?</summary><p>Ask the academy directly about any certification or career support. No accreditation or placement guarantee is represented in this preview.</p></details></div></section>
</Layout>
